     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<div><br></div><div>i want to dispatch my ui.R file into many files for maintenance object, and call them from the ui.R file, for that</div><div>i have created an folder: Pages that contains my r components, my problem is when i call it from the ui.R file</div><div>with the instruction: <div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"color:#000\">source</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">file</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Pages\\fileName.R&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></font></div></code></div><br> the code works, but i have the<font color=\"#990000\"><b> true word printed after the component</b></font>?</div><div><br></div><div>Example:</div><div>fileName.R:</div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><div><font color=\"#660066\">div(class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;,</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>div(class=&quot;row-fluid&quot;,</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>   div(class=&quot;span2&quot;,</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t</span>h3(&quot;test1&quot;)</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>   ),</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>   div(class=&quot;span2&quot;,</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t\t</span>   h3(&quot;test2&quot;)</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>   ),</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>   div(class=&quot;span2&quot;,</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t\t</span>   h3(&quot;test3&quot;)</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>   ),</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>   div(class=&quot;span2&quot;,</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t\t</span>   h3(&quot;test4&quot;)</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>   ),</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>   div(class=&quot;span2&quot;,</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t\t</span>   h3(&quot;test5&quot;)</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>   ),</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>   div(class=&quot;span2&quot;,</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t\t</span>   h3(&quot;test6&quot;)</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>   )</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>   )<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">   )</font></div></div></code></div><br>and the result is:</div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-VqTWfBSyl9g/VIgTNtAPkvI/AAAAAAAAAA4/Z4fMPF-nl58/s1600/source.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-VqTWfBSyl9g/VIgTNtAPkvI/AAAAAAAAAA4/Z4fMPF-nl58/s1600/source.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401115267000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Qv7ZM6dloElUOCL4mvC8y\"><img src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-VqTWfBSyl9g/VIgTNtAPkvI/AAAAAAAAAA4/Z4fMPF-nl58/s320/source.PNG\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" h